# A1/01_greetings.letz

@lesson A1.01 "Basic Greetings"

@word Moien = morning
@word Moien = hi
@word Äddi = bye
@word Äddi = goodbye
@word Merci = thanks
@word Merci = thank you
@word W.e.g. = please
@word Jo = yes
@word Nee = no
@word Entschëllegt = excuse me
@word Entschëllegt = sorry
@word Wéi geet et? = How are you?
@word Mir geet et gutt = I'm fine
@word Gudde Moien = Good morning
@word Gudden Owend = Good evening
@word Gudde Mëtteg = Good afternoon
@word Schlof gutt = Sleep well
@word Bis muer = See you tomorrow
@word Bis geschwënn = See you soon

@sentence
@lu Gudde Moien, wéi geet et?
@en Good morning, how are you?
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-en goodbye
@distractor-lu Owend
@distractor-lu Äddi

@sentence
@lu Mir geet et gutt, merci.
@en I'm fine, thank you.
@en I am fine, thank you.
@distractor-en terrible
@distractor-en bad
@distractor-lu schlecht
@distractor-lu net

@sentence
@lu Äddi, bis geschwënn!
@en Goodbye, see you soon!
@distractor-en hello
@distractor-en tomorrow
@distractor-lu Moien
@distractor-lu muer

@sentence
@lu Entschëllegt, wéi geet et?
@en Excuse me, how are you?
@distractor-en please
@distractor-en fine
@distractor-lu Merci
@distractor-lu Jo

@sentence
@lu Gudde Mëtteg, merci fir alles.
@en Good afternoon, thank you for everything.
@distractor-en morning
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu Moien
@distractor-lu Owend
